SUMMARY:Wharton Arts Fall Fest
DESCRIPTION:Wharton Arts Fall Fest\nFriday\, October 30 from 4:30-6:30 p.m.\nWharton Performing Arts School\n60 Locust Avenue\, Berkeley Heights\nFREE Event \nCalling all goblins and ghouls! Wear your Halloween costume and join us for an instrument petting zoo\, student performances\, treats\, and spooky festivities. Enjoy cider and donuts\, games\, arts and crafts\, and a costume contest! The Wharton Arts Fall Fest is sure to be fun for the whole family. \n4:30-6:30 PM Instrument Petting Zoo\, Games\, and more!\n6:30 PM Costume Contest Winners Announced\n7:00 PM Suzuki Halloween Playdown in the Wharton Black Box Theater \nQuestions? Call (908) 790-0700 or email info@whartonarts.org.
URL:https://whartonarts.org/calendar/fall-fest/
LOCATION:Wharton Institute for the Performing Arts\, 60 Locust Avenue\, Berkeley Heights\, NJ\, 07922\, United States
CATEGORIES:NJYC,NJYS,PAS,PMP,Wharton
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://whartonarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Wharton-Arts-Fall-Fest-web.jpg
END:VEVENT
