SUMMARY:PAS Suzuki Halloween Playdown
DESCRIPTION:PAS Suzuki Halloween Playdown\nOctober 30\, 2026 at 7:00 p.m.\nWharton Black Box Theater\, Berkeley Heights\nFREE Event \nSpend Halloween Eve with Performing Arts School violin students of all ages as they perform favorite selections from the Suzuki repertoire. \nWharton Performing Arts School Violin Students Elzibieta Winnicki\, Violin Andrzej Winnicki\, Piano
