SUMMARY:Wharton CAFÉ Choir
DESCRIPTION:Wharton CAFÉ Choir \nNovember 18\, 2026 at 12:30 p.m.\nWharton Black Box Theater\, Berkeley Heights\nFREE Event \nEnjoy an entertaining program from our Creative Aging for Everyone Choir\, featuring beloved hits\, classic choral works\, and favorite show tunes. Come celebrate the joy of singing and music-making together! Made possible by funds from the New Jersey State Council on the Arts\, a partner agency of the National Endowment for the Arts.
URL:https://whartonarts.org/calendar/wharton-cafe-choir/
LOCATION:Wharton Black Box Theater\, 60 Locust Ave\, Berkeley Heights\, NJ\, 07922\, United States
CATEGORIES:PAS,Wharton
